[{"id":"1061823696946585600","date":1541993471000,"rawContent":"Carlebach was also hugely influential in creating a neo-Hasidic revival, both in more liberal\/Renewal directions and in more Orthodox ones. He also caused a lot of people to need to say #metoo.","userId":61802282,"media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":78,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":65,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1066896080409899008","date":1543202822000,"rawContent":"@sberg0 Did you not follow the rise of #blacklivesmatter and #nodapl--what ppl were\/are fighting for, and the fact that the govt went at protesters in both cases with teargas? For two examples among many?","userId":61802282,"media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":79,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":65,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1067076030492479488","date":1543245725000,"rawContent":"God makes it clear that sexual abuse is not OK--God sends plagues to Pharoah.  Again, the Exodus story foreshadowing. And Abraham takes property with him as he goes--another parallel.  (But note that #MeToo here is parallel to enslavement--God's not down with sexual abuse.)","userId":61802282,"media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":79,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":66,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1067077577037307904","date":1543246094000,"rawContent":"This is all Gen 11-12, btw.  Then we skip to Gen 16, same parsha\/Torah portion, and Sarah can't get pregnant.  So she offers Hagar, the woman enslaved to her, to Abraham. Another situation of sexual abuse--an enslaved woman isn't in a position to consent.  #metoo.","userId":61802282,"media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":79,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":67,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1070156555004317696","date":1543980179000,"rawContent":"The Moonves news is like so many of these revelations, showing us that many, many, many people were aware of and complicit in sexual abuse by powerful men. \n\n#Metoo has begun to impact the lives of (some) abusers (a little bit). \n\nIt's time to talk about complicity and enabling.","userId":61802282,"media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":79,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":68,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1070766783282495490","date":1544125669000,"rawContent":"Hey, non-survivor cis guys looking to speak out on #MeToo-related topics!  First of all, good work, thank you.  Second of all-- please read this for some tips about how to do that appropriately and responsibly.\n\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/Il3GNmSAHm","userId":61802282,"media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":79,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":69,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1070832006282600448","date":1544141220000,"rawContent":"4  Tips for non-survivor cis men who want to speak out publicly about #metoo and sexual abuse--how to do so responsibly, appropriately, &amp; not centering yourself. \n\nPlease read and consider amplifying.  by me, @hanneblank and @GuilaBen. \n\nThread.  Link to article at the end. 1\/x","userId":61802282,"media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":79,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":70,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1070832007868047360","date":1544141220000,"rawContent":"How would a victim hear your words? In what ways would it comfort them? Hurt them? It might be wise to run a draft of your comments by a survivor of sexual violence and\/or someone with another kind of #MeToo history.","userId":61802282,"media":null,"username":"TheRaDR","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":79,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":71,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1073032811370692608","date":1544665932000,"rawContent":"What religious leadership looks like.\n\nThe Episcopal church is suspending, for 3 years, the statue of limitations on initiating proceedings in cases of clergy sexual misconduct.  Making sure everybody can report. #metoo\n\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/MmViQairLk","userId":61802282,"media":null,"userna